1
00:00:00,360 --> 00:00:02,320
(Penny:)It won't happen again. What's up?

2
00:00:02,487 --> 00:00:06,117
(Sheldon:)Nothing. Just wanted to see
if you were both okay.

3
00:00:06,324 --> 00:00:08,744
(Leonard:)We're fine, Sheldon.

4
00:00:08,910 --> 00:00:10,740
(Sheldon:)All right, then.

5
00:00:10,912 --> 00:00:13,752
(Policeman:)-Good night.
PENNY: Good night.

6
00:00:15,041 --> 00:00:17,541
-Well, that was weird. Even for him.
-Mm.

7
00:00:17,710 --> 00:00:18,840
[KNOCKING]

8
00:00:19,003 --> 00:00:22,803
SHELDON: Leonard and Penny.
Leonard and Penny. Leonard and Penny.

9
00:00:23,675 --> 00:00:26,345
(Penny:)Who is it?

10
00:00:26,511 --> 00:00:29,431
(Sheldon:)Sheldon. Sheldon Cooper.

11
00:00:29,639 --> 00:00:33,139
(Penny:)-Yes?
-May I come in?

12
00:00:34,519 --> 00:00:36,399
(Penny:)Yeah.

13
00:00:44,320 --> 00:00:46,950
(Sheldon:)I see you're drinking wine.

14
00:00:47,657 --> 00:00:50,197
(Leonard:)Yes, we are. And we're about
to go to bed.

15
00:00:50,827 --> 00:00:52,617
(Sheldon:)Uh-huh.

16
00:00:53,538 --> 00:00:56,378
Sheldon, do you wanna
sleep here tonight?

17
00:00:56,541 --> 00:00:58,021
(Sheldon:)As small as Leonard is...

